This analysis was conducted as a part of the work of the Dresser Lab at BIDMC ED, Boston, MA. 

PIs: Caleb J. Dresser MD MPH, Gregory Wellenius ScD. 

The objective of the CCIHS (Climate Change Impacts on Health(care) Systems) is to determine if there is a relationship between certain weather variables and operational outcomes of interest to healthcare systems.

